IGEL_USB_SOUND_SENNHEISER_QUIRKS
	  Various Sennheiser headset quirks and fixes to get things running and
	  fix audio mixing problems. For usb audio use a delay for 50msec after
	  set Cur on a Sennheiser headset.
	  
	  Works for Sennheiser SC630, SC660, SC260, SC60, SC45/SC75 and BTD800

	  Source: IGEL
